# PSP-CBDC-ML × Polkadot Integration

### 🔍 Project Overview
This branch integrates **Polkadot blockchain** into the existing
**CBDC + ML risk-monitoring system**.

- **CBDC Layer** → Simulates retail or wholesale CBDC transactions  
- **ML Layer** → Detects anomalies in transaction patterns  
- **Blockchain Layer (Polkadot)** → Records verified transactions immutably  

### 🎯 Hackathon Goal
Demonstrate a **machine-learning-enabled CBDC ledger** using the Polkadot testnet.

